  triage:title "Hard Merge Gate LOC violation on AG.18" ;
  triage:description "sprint-AG18.md:328-337 requires >= -100 net LOC across crates/ in named target files; actual measured diff (9a52c0f0..1b25b36c) is +966 net LOC in named target files (21 files, +2045/-1079), and +1916 net LOC across all of crates/ (56 files, +3203/-1287). ~10-19x over ceiling in wrong direction. Triple-corroborated by req-qa, arch-qa, and quality-mgr's own independent measurement." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AG" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
