  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s18/1b25b36c> ;
  triage:notes "INITIAL PASS: AG.18 sprint fails Hard Merge Gate LOC requirement by ~10-19x in wrong direction. Measurement scope: named target files identified in sprint-AG18.md (21 files across crates/atm-core, crates/atm, crates/atm-daemon). Gate violation is mechanical blocker preventing merge to integrate/phase-AG. Root cause analysis via QA verdict identifies out-of-sequence scope creep (AG.25-assigned cross_host.rs) as primary LOC driver. Dispatch ready: true; however, merge gate fix is prerequisite for any higher sprint advancement." .

